The expression is "2-1-1".
Keep a shared numbers as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared opercodes as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared table as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared counts as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared capacity as 0.
Set capacity to 4.
Keep a shared width as 0.
Set width to 3.
The number is 0.
The last is the last position of expression.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The symbol is character spot of expression.
If symbol is between "0" and "9", The digit is the digit value of symbol, set number to number times 10 plus digit.
If symbol is "+", Place number into numbers, Place 1 into opercodes, set number to 0.
If symbol is "-", Place number into numbers, Place 2 into opercodes, set number to 0.
If symbol is "*", Place number into numbers, Place 3 into opercodes, set number to 0.

Place number into numbers.
For every slot from 0 to 35.
Place 0 into table.

For every slot from 0 to 8.
Place 0 into counts.

To solve from start (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
The cell is start times width plus finish.
If start is finish, set item cell of counts to 1, set item (cell times capacity) of table to item start of numbers, return.
Set item cell of counts to 0.
The splitlast is finish minus 1.
For every split from start to splitlast.
Solve from start with split.
Solve from split plus 1 with finish.
The leftcell is start times width plus split.
The rightcell is (split plus 1) times width plus finish.
The leftcount is item leftcell of counts.
The rightcount is item rightcell of counts.
The oper is item split of opercodes.
The leftlast is leftcount minus 1.
For every leftslot from 0 to leftlast.
The leftvalue is item (leftcell times capacity plus leftslot) of table.
The rightlast is rightcount minus 1.
For every rightslot from 0 to rightlast.
The rightvalue is item (rightcell times capacity plus rightslot) of table.
The value is 0.
If oper is 1, set value to leftvalue plus rightvalue.
If oper is 2, set value to leftvalue minus rightvalue.
If oper is 3, set value to leftvalue times rightvalue.
The slotindex is item cell of counts.
The spot is cell times capacity plus slotindex.
Set item spot of table to value.
Set item cell of counts to slotindex plus 1.

Solve from 0 with 2.
The finalcell is 2.
The total is item finalcell of counts.
The answers is an empty list of whole numbers.
The lastslot is total minus 1.
For every slot from 0 to lastslot.
The answer is item (finalcell times capacity plus slot) of table.
Place answer into answers.

Sort answers.
For each answer in answers, show answer.
